      "description": "Fashion. Beauty. Home.\n\nExplore 16,000+ of your favourite brands across fashion, beauty & home, anytime, anywhere with the Debenhams app.\n\nBe inspired by the latest trends in Fashion from British names you love, including Coast, Karen Millen, Warehouse, Oasis, Burton, DP and Misspap.\n\nElevate your Beauty routine with iconic names to covet, stocking up on skincare, makeup and signature fragrances you’ll fall in love with. With names such as Estée Lauder, YSL, Hugo Boss and more, your beauty collection has never looked better.\n\nDiscover stylish options for every home. From a seasonal refresh to those everyday essentials we've got you covered with tasteful touches through bedding, tableware and furniture updates, ready for family moments and entertaining with friends. Add a hint of SMEG, Slumberdown and Yankee Candle to your space and enjoy a haven that feels like home.\n\nOpt in to receive our push notifications, so you can stay in the loop on exclusive offers and launches. Trust us, you don’t want to miss them.\n\nEnjoy a secure checkout, every time, meaning you can shop your favourites quickly and with ease. Thank us later.\n\nTrack your order from discovery to delivery and follow your parcel’s journey to your door.\n\nWith every lifestyle in mind, Debenhams has something for everyone to discover, shop and love. Keep an eye out for some famous faces in collaboration with our renowned brands, so you can be inspired in this season and the next. We’re owning the everyday, and we can’t wait for you to join us.",
